n 2[CIRCLE] of your drop zone, and more than [SQUARE] from enemy operatives and your opponent\'s drop zone*.\nOperatives set up in this manner cannot make shooting attacks or perform the Charge action during the first Turning Point.<br/>\n*In ordinary circumstances, this will always be more than [SQUARE] from your opponent\'s drop zone, but some mission maps may differ (e.g. Shadow Operations).\n<br/><br/>\nIf you are using the Close Quarters rules, at the end of the Set Up Operatives step, in an order of your choice, up to three friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives that have a Conceal order and are wholly within your drop zone make perform up to two different actions from the following for free:\n<ul>\n<li>Normal Move</li>\n<li>Operate Hatch</li>\n<li>Dash</li>\n</ul>\nOperatives that do so cannot make shooting attackes or perform the Charge action during the first Turning Point.'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','THEYN','OC','Outright Conviction','The first time this operative would be incapacitated during the battle, it is left with 1 Wound remaining instead, and cannot be incapacitated for the remainder of the action.\nAll remaning Attack Dice are discarded (including yours if this operative is fighting in combat).'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','THEYN','RES','Resourceful','Keep a pool of Resourceful Points. In the Ready Operatives step of each Turning Point after the first, add Resourceful Points to your pool determined by the number of friendly HERNKY YAEGIR operatives in the killzone that are not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.\nAt the end of each Turning Point, discard the Resourceful Points in your pool.\n<table style=\"width: 100%\">\n<tr><th>Operatives</th><th>Resourceful Points</th></tr>\n<tr><td>6+</td><td>2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3-5</td><td>1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>0-2</td><td>0</td></tr>\n</table>\nEach time a friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative that is not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative is activated, you can spend one of your Resourceful Points to do one of the following effects:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to its APL</li>\n<li>It regains 1D3 + 1 lost Wounds</li>\n</ul>'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','THEYN','VA','Veteran Adventurer','In the Ready Operatives step of each Turning Point after the first, if this operative is not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative, add 1 Resourceful point to your pool.'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','TRK','DLX','Dauntless Explorers','If you are not using the Close Quarters rules, in the Set Up Operatives step, up to three friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives can be set up with a Conceal order wholly within 2[CIRCLE] of your drop zone, and more than [SQUARE] from enemy operatives and your opponent\'s drop zone*.\nOperatives set up in this manner cannot make shooting attacks or perform the Charge action during the first Turning Point.<br/>\n*In ordinary circumstances, this will always be more than [SQUARE] from your opponent\'s drop zone, but some mission maps may differ (e.g. Shadow Operations).\n<br/><br/>\nIf you are using the Close Quarters rules, at the end of the Set Up Operatives step, in an order of your choice, up to three friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives that have a Conceal order and are wholly within your drop zone make perform up to two different actions from the following for free:\n<ul>\n<li>Normal Move</li>\n<li>Operate Hatch</li>\n<li>Dash</li>\n</ul>\nOperatives that do so cannot make shooting attackes or perform the Charge action during the first Turning Point.'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','TRK','PSV','Pan Spectral Visor','When determining Line of Sight for this operative, enemy operatives within [PENT] of it that aren\'t Ready:\n<ul>\n<li>Cannot be Obscured</li>\n<li>Are treated as having an Engage order</li>\n</ul>'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','TRK','RES','Resourceful','Keep a pool of Resourceful Points. In the Ready Operatives step of each Turning Point after the first, add Resourceful Points to your pool determined by the number of friendly HERNKY YAEGIR operatives in the killzone that are not within 