','SHT','TRP','SHT','Shooter','This NPO can perform two Shoot actions if it is on Vantage terrain.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT','WAR','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fall Back to heavy terrain. If possible, to a vantage terrain where there is a valid target that isn’t obscured. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Reposition to vantage terrain feature if possible. If not, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT','WAR','SHT','Shooter','This NPO can perform two Shoot actions if it is on Vantage terrain.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD','HVY','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment frag grenade.</li>\n<li>Dash to light terrain. If possible, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD','HVY','SLD','Soldier 3\"','Treat this NPO\'s APL state as being 1 higher when it is within 3\" of an objective marker.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD','TGH','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipmen