rst two actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 6\" objective marker if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Dash to light or heavy terrain. If possible, to where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun grenade.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','HVY','SPEC','Specialist 6\"','Improve this NPO\'s Save stat by 1 when it is within 6\" of an objective marker.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','TGH','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform either of its first two actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 6\" objective marker if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Dash to light or heavy terrain. If possible, to where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun grenade.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','TGH','SPEC','Specialist','Improve this NPO\'s Save stat by 1 when it is within 3\" of an objective marker.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','TRP','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform either of its first two actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 6\" objective marker if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Dash to light or heavy terrain. If possible, to where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun grenade.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','TRP','SPEC','Specialist','Improve this NPO\'s Save stat by 1 when it is within 3\" of an objective marker.'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','WAR','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform either of its first two actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 6\" objective marker if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Dash to light or heavy terrain. If possible, to where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun grenade.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC','WAR','SPEC','Specialist','Improve this NPO\'s Save stat by 1 when it is within 3\" of an objective marker.'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','HVY','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Charge the closest enemy operative via the shortest route possible.</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun or Frag grenade.</li>\n<li>Dash to light terrain. If possible, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','HVY','TAC','Tactical','This NPO can perform two Shoot actions during its activation.'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','TGH','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Charge the closest enemy operative via the shortest route possible.</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun or Frag grenade.</li>\n<li>Dash to light terrain. If possible, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n</ol>\n'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','TGH','TAC','Tactical','This NPO can perform two Shoot actions during its activation.'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','TRP','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Charge the closest enemy operative via the shortest route possible.</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun or Frag grenade.</li>\n<li>Dash to light terrain. If possible, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n</ol>'),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC','WAR','BEH','Behaviour','When activated, if this NPO can perform any of its first three actions during that activation, give it an Engage order.<br/>\nIf if cannot, give it a Conceal order.\n<ol>\n<li>Fight</li>\n<li>Shoot</li>\n<li>Charge the closest enemy operative via the shortest route possible.</li>\n<li>Reposition to a location within 3\" of another NPO if possible. If not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n<li>Shoot universal equipment Stun or Frag grenade.</li>\n<li>Dash to light terrain. If possible, to a location where there is a valid target that is not obscured, if not, where there is an objective marker visible to this NPO.</li>\n</ol>'),('AEL','MND','MND','AB','BF','Balefire','Each time a friendly MANDRAKE operative makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that has one of your Balefire tokens, for that shooting attack, add 1 to both Damage characteristics of that friendly operative\'s ranged weapons and they have the No Cover special rule.\nEach time a shooting attack is made against a friendly MANDRAKE operative that has one of your Balefire tokens, subtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of the enemy operative\'s ranged weapons for that shooting attack (to a minimum of 1).'),('AEL','MND','MND','AB','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','AB','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','AB','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND','MND','COTF','PC','Part Collector','Each time an enemy operative performs the Fall Back action within Engagement Range of this operative, you can use this ability.\nIf you do so, that enemy operative suffers 1D6 Mortal Wounds before it moves.'),('AEL','MND','MND','COTF','SH','Soul Harvest','Each time an enemy operative is incapacitated as a result of this operative\'s Part Collector ability or Baleblade (including as a result of its Reap critical hit rule),\r add one of your Sould Harvest tokens to your pool, or two if that enemy operative had an APL characteristic of 3 or more.\r Each time a friendly MANDRAKE operative is activated, you can spend one of your Soul Harvest tokens to either add 1 to that operative\'s APL until the end of the battle,\r or have it regain 1D6 lost Wounds. You can spend your Soul Harvest tokens even if this operative has been incapacitated.'),('AEL','MND','MND','COTF','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','COTF','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','COTF','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND','MND','DM','HF','Haunting Focus','Once in each Strategy Phase, when it is your turn to use a Strategic Ploy or pass, you can use this ability instead.\nIf you do so, select one enemy operative for this operative to focus on until the end of the Turning Point.\nWhen your opponent would activate that enemy operative, if this operative is Ready, you can activate this operative first.\nIf you do so, during that activation, you cannot select any other enemy operatives as targets for combat or shooting attacks made by this operative while that enemy operative is in the killzone.'),('AEL','MND','MND','DM','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','DM','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','DM','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND','MND','NF','HW','Harrowing Whispers','Each time your opponent would activate a ready enemy operative within [PENT] of this operative, you can roll 1D6. If the result is greater than that enemy operative\'s APL, they cannot activate it in this activation.\nIf there are no other enemy operatives eligible to be activated, this ability has no effect.'),('AEL','MND','MND','NF','OUB','Oubliex','At the start of each Turning Point, or if this operative incapacitates an enemy operative with its Huskblade, its Oubliex becomes active.\r While its Oubliex is active, each time an attack die would inflict damage on this operative, you can roll 1D6: on a 5+, ignore the damage inflicted from that attack die and this operative\'s Oubliex is no longer active.'),('AEL','MND','MND','NF','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','NF','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','NF','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND','MND','SW','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','SW','SP','Shadow Portal','Any number of friendly MANDRAKE operatives can perform the Shadow Passage action each Turning Point if they start that action wihin [CIRCLE] of one of your Shadow Portal tokens, and finish that action within [CIRCLE] of the other (see Open Shadow Portal).<br/>\nThis does not prevent one operative from perform the Shadow Passage action as normal. You can use this ability even if this operative is incapacitated.'),('AEL','MND','MND','SW','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','SW','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND','MND','WAR','SHAD','Shadow','An operative is within Shadow if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Heavy part of a terrain feature, and that part is not lower than it</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n<li>It is within [TRI] of a Shadow Portal</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','WAR','SS','*Soulstrike','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this Weapon, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, successful saves are determined differently:\n<ul>\n<li>Invulnerable Saves cannot be used</li>\n<li>Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL is a successful save and is retained</li>\n<li>Each result that is higher than the target\'s APL is discarded</li>\n<li>Each retained result of 1 is a Critical Save</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND','MND','WAR','SW','Shadow Warrior','While this operative is within Shadow, add 1 to the Critical Damage characteristic of its Glimmersteel Blade.'),('AEL','MND','MND','WAR','UE','Umbral Entities','This operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.<br/>\nIf this operative is within Shadow, it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','ABS','BF','Balefire','Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is shooting an enemy operative that has one of your Balefire tokens add 1 to both DMG stats of that friendly operative\'s ranged weapons and they have the Saturate weapon rule.\nWhenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative that has one of your Balefire tokens, subtract 1 from both DMG stats of that operative\'s ranged weapons (to a minimum of 1).'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','ABS','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','ABS','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','ABS','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','ABS','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','PC','Part Collector','Whenever an enemy operative performs the Fall Back action while within control range of this operative, you can use this rule. If you do, inflict 2D3 damage on that enemy operative before it moves.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','SH','Soul Harvest','Whenever an enemy operative is incapacitated as a result of this operative\'s Part Collector rule or Baleblade, you gain 1 Soul Harvest point, or 2 if the enemy operative had an APL stat of 3 or more.\nWhenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is activated, you can spend 1 of your Soul Harvest points to either add 1 to its APL stat until the end of the battle, or to have it regain 2D3 lost wounds.\nNote you can spend your Soul Harvest points even if this operative is incapacitated.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','COTF','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','DM','HF','Haunting Focus','Select one enemy operative.\nUntil the ready step of the next strategy phase, it gains your Haunting Focus token.\nThe next time your opponent activates an enemy operative that has your Haunting Focus token, if this operative is ready, you can interrupt that activation and activate this operative.\nIf you do, during that activation, this operative must fight against or shoot against that enemy operative, and cannot do so against any other enemy operatives until it does (if this is not possible, the activation is cancelled).\nAfter completing this operative\'s activation, continue that enemy operative\'s activation.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','DM','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','DM','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','DM','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','DM','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','HW','Harrowing Whispers','Whenever your opponent would activate an enemy operative within 6\" of this operative, you can roll one die.\nIf the result is higher than the enemy operative\'s APL stat, they cannot activate it during this activation.\nIf there are no other enemy operatives eligible to be activated, this rule has no effect.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','OUB','Oubliex','Whenever this operative is readied, or if this operative incapacitates an enemy with its huskblade, its Oubliex becomes active.\nWhenever its oubliex is active and an attack dice would inflict damage on this operative, you can roll one d6, on a 5+ ignore the damage inflicted from that attack dice and the oubliex is no longer active.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','NF','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','SW','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','SW','SPRT','Shadow Portal','Whenever this operative performs the Reposition action using a SHADOW PASSAGE, you can use this rule.\nIf you do so, remove your Shadow Portal markers from the killzone (if any), then place one of your Shadow Portal markers within this operative\'s control range before it is removed\nand one within its control range after it is set up.<br/>\nEach friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE each turning point (taking precedence over one operative once per turning point).\nIf one of your Shadow Portal markers is within that operative\'s control range when it is removed, and the other when it is set up.\nNote that friendly operatives can do this even if this operative has been incapacitated, and doing so does not prevent the operative from using a SHADOW PASSAGE in the normal manner.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','SW','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','SW','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','SW','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','WAR','SP','Shadow Passage','Once per turning point, one friendly MANDRAKE operative can use a SHADOW PASSAGE when it performs the reposition action.\nIf it does, do not move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up WITHIN SHADOW.\nWhen you set it back up it cannot:\n<ul>\n<li>Be within control range of an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Be a valid target for an enemy operative.</li>\n<li>Perform the shoot or fight action until the start of the next turning point.</li>\n</ul>'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','WAR','SS','*Soulstrike','Successful defence dice are determined differently. Each result that is equal to or less than the target\'s APL stat is a success and is retained.\nEach result that is higher than the target\'s APL stat is a fail and is discarded.\nEach result of a 1 is always a critical success. Each other success is a normal success. Each result of 6 is always a fail.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','WAR','SW','Shadow Warrior','Whenever this operative is WITHIN SHADOW, add 1 to the critical damage stat of its Glimmersteel Blade.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','WAR','UE','Umbral Entities','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly MANDRAKE operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule. Whenever a friendly MANDRAKE operative is WITHIN SHADOW, improve its Save stat by 1.'),('AEL','MND24','MND24','WAR','WS','Within Shadow','An operative is WITHIN SHADOW if any of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is within 1\" of Heavy Terrain that is not lower than it.</li>\n<li>Any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n<li>A Shadow Portal marker is within its control range (See SHADEWEAVER operative).</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','FRM','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','FRM','TER','*Terrorchem','Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack with this weapon, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat or shooting attack,\nthe first time you resolve a Critical Hit (it must be a strike in combat), the enemy operative gains one of your Terrorchem tokens until the end of the battle if it doesn\'t already have one.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','FRM','TP','Terrorchem Poison','In the Ready Operatives step of each Initiative Phase, enemy operatives with a Terrorchem token suffer 1D3 Motal Wounds (roll separately for each), even if this operative has been incapacitated.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','GNR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','HGNR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SCR','AFC','Appetite For Cruelty','Each time this operative fights in combat as the active operative, if the target has less than its starting number of Wounds remaining at the start of that combat, this operative\'s Lightning Claws gain the Lethal 4+ special rule for that combat (instead of Lethal 5+).'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SCR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SCR','SCR','Screecher','While this operative is within [SQUARE] of an enemy operative, worsen the BS and WS characteristics of that enemy operative\'s weapons by 1. This is not cumulative with being injured.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SKT','FTA','Flay Them Alive','Once per Turning Point, when this operative incapacitates and enemy operative within its Engagement Range, select one other enemy operative Visible To and within [PENT] of this operative or the incapacitated enemy operative.\nUntil the start of the next Turning Point, that other enemy operative cannot perform mission actions or the Pick Up action, or control objective markers.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SKT','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','SKT','TOTSP','Tyrant Of The Skinning Pits','Each time this operative fights in combat, subtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of the enemy operative\'s weapons for that combat (to a minimum of 2).'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VEN','IB','Icon Bearer','When determining control of an objective marker, treat this operative\'s APL as being 1 higher. Note that this is not a modifier.\n In Narrative Play, this is cumulative with the Focused Battle Honour.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VEN','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VIS','FB','Foreboding','In the Firefight phase, when it is your turn to activate a Ready friendly operative, you can discard one of your Prescience tokens to skip that activation.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VIS','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VIS','POR','Portent','Once per Turning Point, when this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it, at the start of the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat or shooting attack,\nyou can discard one of your Prescience tokens to discard one of your opponent\'s successful hits.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VIS','PRES','Prescience','Once in each Strategy Phase, when it is your turn to use a Stragegic Ploy or pass, you can use this ability instead.\nIf you do so, add 1D3 Prescience tokens to your pool. Your Prescience tokens are spent on abilities and unique actions on this datacard, but you cannot spend them if this operative is not in the kill zone.'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','WAR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','<em class=\"noprint\">Night Lords are one with darkness, employing it as an ally and a weapon.<br/></em>\n When determining if a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative is in an enemy operative\'s Line Of Sight, that friendly operative is Obscured if all of the following are true:\n <ul>\n <li>It has a Conceal order, regardless of any rules that treat the operative as having an Engage order (e.g. Vantage Point)</li>\n <li>It is within [TRI] of Heavy or Light terrain, and/or any part of its base is underneath a Vantage Point</li>\n <li>It is more than [PENT] from enemy operatives it is Visible To</li>\n </ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','FRM','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','FRM','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','FRM','TC','*Terrochem','In the Resolve Attack Dice step, if you inflict damage with any Critical successes, the operative this weapon is being used against gains one of your Terrorchem tokens (if it does not already have one).'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','FRM','TCP','Terrochem Poison','In the Ready step of each Strategy Phase, 1D3 damage is separately inflicted on each operative that has one of your Terrorchem tokens.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','GNR','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','GNR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','HGNR','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','HGNR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SCR','AFC','Appetite For Cruelty','Whenever this operative is fighting against a wounded enemy operative, this operative\'s lightning claws gain the Lethal 4+ weapon Rule.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SCR','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SCR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SCR','SCR','Screecher','Whenever an enemy operative within 3\" of this operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SKT','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SKT','FTA','Flay Them Alive','Once per turning point, when this operative incapacitates an enemy operative within its control range, you can select one other enemy operative visible to and within 6\" of either this operative or the incapacitated operative.\nUntil the start of the next turning point, that other enemy operative cannot control markers or perform the Pick Up Marker or mission actions.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SKT','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','SKT','TOTSP','Tyrant Of The Skinning Pits','Whenever this operative is fighting or retaliating, Normal and Critical damage of 3 or more inflicts 1 less damage on it.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VEN','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VEN','IB','Icon Bearer','Whenever determining control of a marker, treat this operative\'s APL stat as 1 higher. Note this is not a change to its APL stat, so any changes are cumulative with this.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VEN','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VIS','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VIS','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','VIS','PRE','Prescience','<em>PSYCHIC</em><br/>\nIn the ready step of each Strategy phase, you gain 1D3 Prescience points.\nYou can spend your Prescience points in the Firefight phase as follows (you cannot use each of the following rules more than once per turning point).\n<ul>\n<li>Foreboding: <em>PSYCHIC</em> Whenever it is your turn to activate a friendly operative, you can spend 1 of your Prescience points to skip that activation.</li>\n<li>Portent: <em>PSYCHIC</em> Whenever an attack dice inflicts normal damage on this operative, you can spend 1 of your Prescience points to ignore that inflicted damage.</li>\n</ul>\nYou cannot gain or spend your Prescience points if this operative is incapacitated.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','WAR','AST','Astartes','During each friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative\'s activation, it can perform either 2 Shoot actions or 2 Fight actions.\nIf it is 2 shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or scoped bolt pistol must be selected for at least one of them.\nEach friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative can counteract regardless of its order.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','WAR','CT','Cruel Tormentor','Whenever this operative is shooting against, fighting against, or retaliating against an injured neemy operative, or an enemy operative that has a wounds stat of 7 or less, its weapons have the Lethal 5+ rule.'),('CHAOS','NC24','NC24','WAR','IMC','In Midnight Clad','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that friendly operative is obscured if both of the following are true:\n<ul>\n<li>It is more than 6\" from enemy operatives it is visible to.</li>\n<li>It has Heavy Terrain within its control range, or any part of its base is underneath Vantage terrain.</li>\n</ul>'),('IMP','NOV','NOV','CON','AOF','Act Of Faith','<em>You cannot use Acts of Faith to change dice you\'ve re-rolled</em><br/><b>Armour Of Contempt</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your successful normal saves as a critical save instead.\n<br/>\n<b>Blinding Aura</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen an enemy operative performs a shooting attack, select one friendly NOVITIATE operative. Until the end of that activation, while that friendly operative is more than [CIRCLE] from that enemy operative:\n<ul>\n<li>That friendly operative is treated as being in Cover.</li>\n<li>While that friendly operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Blessed Rejuvenation</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative is activated, it regains D3 lost wounds. This Act of Faith can be used a maximum of two times in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Divine Shield</b>(2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your failed saves as a successful normal save.\n<br/>\n<b>Emperor\'s Protection</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative suffers a mortal wound, ignore that mortal wound. This Act of Faith can be used more than once in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Faithful Blessing</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative is fighting in combat or\nmaking a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made\nagainst it, in the Roll Attack Dice step (for the former) or the Roll\nDefence Dice step (for the latter) of that combat or shooting attack,\nre-roll one of your attack or defence dice. This Act of Faith can be used more than once in each activation, and can be used with other Acts of Faith.\n<br/>\n<b>Guiding Light</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, retain one of your failed hits as a successful normal hit.\n<br/>\n<b>Vengeful Strike</b> (3 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, retain one of your successful normal hits as a critical hit instead.'),('IMP','NOV','NOV','CON','NR','Null Rod','Each time an enemy operative is activated, if it is within [PENT] of this operative for that activation, its APL characteristic cannot be higher than 2. Each time an enemy operative would perform a psychic action, if it is within [PENT] of this operative, 1 additional AP must be subtracted to perform that action.'),('IMP','NOV','NOV','DIA','AOF','Act Of Faith','<em>You cannot use Acts of Faith to change dice you\'ve re-rolled</em><br/><b>Armour Of Contempt</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your successful normal saves as a critical save instead.\n<br/>\n<b>Blinding Aura</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen an enemy operative performs a shooting attack, select one friendly NOVITIATE operative. Until the end of that activation, while that friendly operative is more than [CIRCLE] from that enemy operative:\n<ul>\n<li>That friendly operative is treated as being in Cover.</li>\n<li>While that friendly operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Blessed Rejuvenation</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative is activated, it regains D3 lost wounds. This Act of Faith can be used a maximum of two times in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Divine Shield</b>(2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your failed saves as a successful normal save.\n<br/>\n<b>Emperor\'s Protection</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative suffers a mortal wound, ignore that mortal wound. This Act of Faith can be used more than once in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Faithful Blessing</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative is fighting in combat or\nmaking a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made\nagainst it, in the Roll Attack Dice step (for the former) or the Roll\nDefence Dice step (for the latter) of that combat or shooting attack,\nre-roll one of your attack or defence dice. This Act of Faith can be used more than once in each activation, and can be used with other Acts of Faith.\n<br/>\n<b>Guiding Light</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, retain one of your failed hits as a successful normal hit.\n<br/>\n<b>Vengeful Strike</b> (3 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, retain one of your successful normal hits as a critical hit instead.'),('IMP','NOV','NOV','DUE','AOF','Act Of Faith','<em>You cannot use Acts of Faith to change dice you\'ve re-rolled</em><br/><b>Armour Of Contempt</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your successful normal saves as a critical save instead.\n<br/>\n<b>Blinding Aura</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen an enemy operative performs a shooting attack, select one friendly NOVITIATE operative. Until the end of that activation, while that friendly operative is more than [CIRCLE] from that enemy operative:\n<ul>\n<li>That friendly operative is treated as being in Cover.</li>\n<li>While that friendly operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Blessed Rejuvenation</b> (2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative is activated, it regains D3 lost wounds. This Act of Faith can be used a maximum of two times in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Divine Shield</b>(2 Faith Points)\n<br/>\nWhen a shooting attack is made against a friendly NOVITIATE operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retain one of your failed saves as a successful normal save.\n<br/>\n<b>Emperor\'s Protection</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITIATE operative suffers a mortal wound, ignore that mortal wound. This Act of Faith can be used more than once in each activation.\n<br/>\n<b>Faithful Blessing</b> (1 Faith Point)\n<br/>\nWhen a friendly NOVITI